This directory contains a copy of mdns from:

  - URL: https://github.com/mjansson/mdns
  - Commit: a569c4759bd47e0f2a7bfc4d4c19620445782806

The simplest way of updating its contents is to re-create the directory from scratch, and restoring
the needed files with Git. Example commands:

  rm -rf Source/ThirdParty/mjansson-mdns
  cp -ar ../path/to/mdns Source/ThirdParty/mjansson-mdns
  git checkout -- \
      Source/ThirdParty/mjansson-mdns/README.WebKit \
      Source/ThirdParty/mjansson-mdns/CMakeLists.txt
  rm -rf Source/ThirdParty/mjansson-mdns/.git*
  git add -A Source/ThirdParty/mjansson-mdns

Then check whether the updated sources require any changes to the CMake build system, and update the
commit identifier in this file.
